Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:22:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/15] perf(trafficcraft): reuse state-only outline shapes

TrafficLightBlock, TrafficSignPostBlock and RoadSaltBlock rebuild their
outline shape from the block state alone on every outline and ray query,
with up to seven Shapes.or calls or a new box. Keep the first shape
TrafficCraft returns for each of the block's own states in a concurrent map;
voxel shapes are immutable. Other blocks' states and null states still reach
TrafficCraft's code directly.

